("models","configuration","{\"scope\":\"Mathematical training scenarios with coastal labels; these are not field measurements or validated environmental models.\",\"cellPattern\":[1,0,1,1,0,1,0,1,1,1,0,0,0,1,1,0],\"scenarios\":[{\"id\":\"calibration\",\"title\":\"Marker calibration\",\"input\":{\"angle\":30}},{\"id\":\"pairs\",\"title\":\"Survey allocation pairs\",\"input\":{\"value\":4,\"mode\":\"budget\"}},{\"id\":\"inflate\",\"title\":\"Repeated sampling expansion\",\"input\":{\"step\":4}},{\"id\":\"decode\",\"title\":\"Repeated sensor vote\",\"input\":{\"bits\":[1,0,1]}},{\"id\":\"weights\",\"title\":\"Two-site effort weights\",\"input\":{\"percent\":35}},{\"id\":\"memory\",\"title\":\"Coupled reservoir memory\",\"input\":{\"coupled\":true}},{\"id\":\"line\",\"title\":\"Survey trace geometry\",\"input\":{\"samples\":[{\"t\":0,\"x\":0.4},{\"t\":1,\"x\":0.7},{\"t\":2,\"x\":0.3}],\"coordinate\":\"x\"}},{\"id\":\"coarse\",\"title\":\"Quadrat aggregation\",\"input\":{\"block\":2}}]}")
